186045417] [17592186097776 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186097777 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097776 #edb/ref 1061 618392 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097776 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "fdfdcd42-ada8-5eea-ae27-e68cd87d7470" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097776 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186096835 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097777 #edb/ref 1061 618395 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097777 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "c0d6168f-5f91-5b54-9679-17a077751add" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097777 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186096836 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097927 #edb/ref 1064 "Suppose that we want to evaluate the integral\n\n$$\n\\int x\\ln{x}\\, \\textrm{d}x \\,.\n$$\n\nThe method of integration by parts can help us solve this problem. Let's remind ourselves of the \"by-parts\" formula,\n\n$$\n\\int u v' \\textrm{d}x = uv - \\int v u'\\textrm{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe usually let $u = x,$ but that would leave us with $v' = \\ln(x)$ which is hard to integrate. So instead, we're going to choose our $u$ and $v'$ slightly differently, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x} \\\\ {v}^{′}=x\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow the formula of integration by parts gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}_{⏟}}_{u}\\cdot {{x}_{⏟}}_{{v}^{′}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,{x}^{2}-\\int \\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{x}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\,{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-\\frac{1}{2}\\int x\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\,{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-\\frac{1}{4}{x}^{2}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhen we apply integration by parts to integrals containing logarithmic functions, we should *always* identify the logarithmic function with $u,$ not with $v'.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097927 #edb/ref 1065 897 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097927 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "dbf22d18-c638-527f-a085-8fcc19fbfbeb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097927 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247569 #edb/ref 1080 "{x}^{4}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3x)-1)+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247569 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247569 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "109b22a6-d3dd-5ed0-be45-6c1e67dc6541" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247733 #edb/ref 1080 "{x}^{4}(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3x)-\\frac{1}{2})+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247733 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247733 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "229a39f8-42eb-5bb6-86d4-bbfff2c4c90a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247986 #edb/ref 1080 "-\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)-1}{9{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247986 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247986 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "3f7ca2da-40f3-525c-bac6-b29d8480b2e9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248145 #edb/ref 1080 "{x}^{4}(\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3x)}{3}-1)+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248145 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248145 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "506fd08e-5636-5073-8b9b-999fb05b57d5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248516 #edb/ref 1080 "{x}^{2}(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3x)+1)+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248516 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248516 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7c2a25c7-9320-5224-a084-275ada01afa1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248852 #edb/ref 1080 "-\\frac{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)+1}{9{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248852 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248852 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a01808c9-616c-59db-89e8-974a2c400333" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248883 #edb/ref 1080 "-\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)+1}{3{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248883 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 1