2186045417] [17592186486892 #edb/ref 1080 "x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)-x+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186486892 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186486892 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "892da78f-ab77-5373-bbb0-fa9519ed8163" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487012 #edb/ref 1080 "x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)-x+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487012 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487012 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "be07ae88-63bf-5eff-9610-cc4608d58779" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487112 #edb/ref 1080 "x\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487112 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487112 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "f30a460f-4f9b-5125-8fb4-707677000f2e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487208 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186486645 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487208 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186486871 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487208 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186486892 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487208 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186487012 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487208 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186487112 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487208 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487208 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487208 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186486892 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487208 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "811f8ce1-3fa6-57be-909c-b7ba034a73fc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487315 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186487208 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487315 #edb/ref 1069 "q-30481" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487315 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487315 #edb/ref 1071 "$\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)\\,\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487315 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "328d9940-84c5-5488-9fa8-98ff5e7ef880" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186487315 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we write the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)\\cdot 1\\cdot \\text{d}x.\n$$\n\n \n\nWe will solve this problem using integration by parts. We start by defining $u$ and ${v}^{′},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x+1} \\\\ {v}^{′}=1\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int \\,\\text{d}x=x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u\\,{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)\\cdot x-\\int x\\cdot \\frac{1}{x+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)-\\int \\frac{x}{x+1}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we use a substitution $x+1=u,$ thus $x=u-1$ and $\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.$ Hence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)-\\int \\frac{x}{x+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)-\\int \\frac{u-1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)-\\int \\,\\text{d}u+\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{u} \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)-u+\\operatorname{ln}⁡u+D \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)-(x+1)+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)+D \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)-x+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C=D-1$ is an integral constant." #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
